# The Quizening — CLI Quiz Buzzer Tool

## Run

```bash
python quizening.py
```

## Commands

### PREPARE phase
| Command | Effect |
|---|---|
| `name 1 Alice` | Assign name to button 1 |
| `b1` / `b2` / `b3` / `b4` | Simulate a buzzer press (dev/test only) |
| `start` | Begin the quiz |

### QUIZ phase
| Command | Effect |
|---|---|
| `next` or `n` | Start the next round |
| `end` or `e` | End the quiz, show ranking |
| `Alice +1` | Give Alice a point |
| `Alice -1` | Take a point from Alice |

